{"title": "Caustic Retort (Condition)", "pageid": 27386, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Caustic_Retort_(Condition)", "categories": ["Conditions"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">  \n</p>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\"> \n<div class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/57/Generic_Acid_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Acid_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/57/Generic_Acid_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Generic_Acid_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/57/Generic_Acid_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Generic_Acid_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Generic Acid Condition Icon.webp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/57/Generic_Acid_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Acid_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/5/57/Generic_Acid_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <b>Caustic Retort</b>\n</p>\n</div>\n<ul><li>Whenever you take damage, reflect it back at your attacker threefold as <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Acid\" title=\"Acid\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5f/Acid_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Acid_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5f/Acid_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Acid_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/5f/Acid_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Acid_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Acid\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5f/Acid_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Acid_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/5f/Acid_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Acid\" title=\"Acid\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-acid\">Acid</span></a> damage. </li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\">Properties</span></h2>\n<div class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Ico stats.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span>UID: <code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">DAMAGE_SHIELD_ANY_ACID</code> <span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:DAMAGE_SHIELD_ANY_ACID+type:status\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:DAMAGE_SHIELD_ANY_ACID+type:status\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\">Notes</span></h2>\n<ul><li>Resistance to acid damage will result in attackers taking 150% of damage dealt.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Creatures_with_Caustic_Retort\">Creatures with Caustic Retort</span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition-sources\"><ul>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Cursed_Imp\" title=\"Cursed Imp\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/32/Portrait_Cursed_Imp.png/30px-Portrait_Cursed_Imp.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/32/Portrait_Cursed_Imp.png/45px-Portrait_Cursed_Imp.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/32/Portrait_Cursed_Imp.png/60px-Portrait_Cursed_Imp.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Cursed Imp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/32/Portrait_Cursed_Imp.png/30px-Portrait_Cursed_Imp.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/32/Portrait_Cursed_Imp.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Cursed_Imp\" title=\"Cursed Imp\">Cursed Imp</a></li>\n</ul></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714201955\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.048 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.051 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1266/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 14164/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 4963/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 28/200\nExpensive parser function count: 1/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 4/1000\nLua time usage: 0.020/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 972302/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   46.009      1 Template:Condition_page\n100.00%   46.009      1 -total\n 64.76%   29.797      2 Template:Hidden_code\n 30.39%   13.982      2 Template:Condition_sources\n 17.61%    8.101      1 Template:PageSeo\n 14.08%    6.477      1 Template:Condition_sources/format\n 13.97%    6.426      3 Template:Template_style\n 12.82%    5.897      2 Template:Icon_link\n 12.82%    5.897      1 Template:MdCharLink\n 12.81%    5.892     16 Template:Trim\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:27386-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714201955 and revision id 395150. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}